{"id":"f63c4c620ad75ba4","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-omega-rule-soundness.md","title":"PA加ω规则的标准模型可靠性","display":"thm-omega-rule-soundness — PA加ω规则的标准模型可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-omega-rule-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-omega-rule-soundness"],"display":"thm-omega-rule-soundness — PA加ω规则的标准模型可靠性","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge]]","[[72-df-omega-proof]]","[[72-df-omega-rule-sequent]]","[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local well-founded standard-model soundness argument for the recorded PA-plus-omega calculus; omega-rule background Ch.III §3.1, print164–166/PDF176–178","verification_status":"local-argument-reviewed; exact source theorem not claimed","proof_status":"explicit arithmetic/core syntax bridge supplied; local semantic induction reviewed; no machine verification","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-omega-rule-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-omega-rule-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-rule-soundness — PA加ω规则的标准模型可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d84a32e163edd84\" href=\"?note=2d84a32e163edd84\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge\">72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f57c523092bba1d6\" href=\"?note=f57c523092bba1d6\" title=\"72-df-omega-proof\">72-df-omega-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ba5875c85771b52\" href=\"?note=9ba5875c85771b52\" title=\"72-df-omega-rule-sequent\">72-df-omega-rule-sequent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local well-founded standard-model soundness argument for the recorded PA-plus-omega calculus; omega-rule background Ch.III §3.1, print164–166/PDF176–178"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-argument-reviewed; exact source theorem not claimed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"explicit arithmetic/core syntax bridge supplied; local semantic induction reviewed; no machine verification"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_A\">\\(\\Sigma_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_f\">\\(J_f\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}\">\\(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2d84a32e163edd84\" href=\"?note=2d84a32e163edd84\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge\">72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge</a>；core公式集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\Sigma_A}\">\\(X_{\\Sigma_A}\\)</span>，变量集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>。目标相继式中的等式使用core构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span>，不是两类算术语法中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=\">\\(=\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma_A}(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma_A}(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA})\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OmegaProof}_{\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{OmegaProof}_{\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f57c523092bba1d6\" href=\"?note=f57c523092bba1d6\" title=\"72-df-omega-proof\">72-df-omega-proof</a>：实际证明对象为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega},\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega},\\eta\\rangle\\)</span>，已经包含局部合法性与良基性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\ell(())\">\\(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\ell(())\\)</span> 为其根相继式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_A}\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}\\)</span> 的core语义接口取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a>。标准结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_A\">\\(\\mathfrak N_A\\)</span> 的四个分量在Assertion中给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\cdot,&lt;\">\\(0,S,+,\\cdot,&lt;\\)</span> 在解释函数左侧为签名符号，在右侧为标准自然数运算或关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_F&amp;:=\\{\\langle S,\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle,n+1\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle,\\langle+,\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,m+n\\rangle:m,n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle,\\langle\\cdot,\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,m\\cdot n\\rangle:m,n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_R&amp;:=\\{\\langle&lt;,\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\omega^2:m&lt;n\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak N_A&amp;:=\\langle\\omega,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\Sigma_A}&amp;:=\\{A\\in X_{\\Sigma_A}:\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_F&amp;:=\\{\\langle S,\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle,n+1\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle,\\langle+,\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,m+n\\rangle:m,n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle,\\langle\\cdot,\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,m\\cdot n\\rangle:m,n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_R&amp;:=\\{\\langle&lt;,\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\omega^2:m&lt;n\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak N_A&amp;:=\\langle\\omega,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\Sigma_A}&amp;:=\\{A\\in X_{\\Sigma_A}:\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_A}(\\mathfrak N_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_A}(\\mathfrak N_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma_A}(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA})\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\Sigma_A}\\quad\\bigl[\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\langle(),\\langle\\sigma\\rangle\\rangle\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak N_A\\models\\sigma\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma_A}(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA})\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\Sigma_A}\\quad\\bigl[\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\langle(),\\langle\\sigma\\rangle\\rangle\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak N_A\\models\\sigma\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma_A}(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA})\\quad\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\langle(),\\langle J_f(0=S0)\\rangle\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma_A}(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA})\\quad\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\langle(),\\langle J_f(0=S0)\\rangle\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对良基证明树的孩子关系作归纳。有限LK规则按已经给出的标准结构语义保持相继式有效性；PA公理的真值由自然数运算和实际自然数归纳给出；ω规则的全部标准数码前提为真时，其全称结论为真。根是单句相继式时得到可靠性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_f(0=S0)\">\\(J_f(0=S0)\\)</span> 是core公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\doteq S0\">\\(0\\doteq S0\\)</span>，在该结构中为假，故不可能作为闭证明的结论。</p>\n<p>本文件陈述PA加ω规则的外部标准模型可靠性，而非通常意义的ω一致性定理。文件名因此改为72-thm-omega-rule-soundness；没有改变ω一致性定理文件72-thm-omega-consistency-theorem。论证使用ZFC中的良基归纳，不声称对象演算证明自己的可靠性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge","status":"resolved","id":"2d84a32e163edd84","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-omega-proof","status":"resolved","id":"f57c523092bba1d6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-omega-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-omega-rule-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"9ba5875c85771b52","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-omega-rule-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge","status":"resolved","id":"2d84a32e163edd84","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_A$、$J_f$、$\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}$、$\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-sequent-bridge]]；core公式集为 $X_{\\Sigma_A}$，变量集为 $V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}$。目标相继式中的等式使用core构造子 $\\doteq$，不是两类算术语法中的 $=$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-omega-proof","status":"resolved","id":"f57c523092bba1d6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma_A}(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA})$ 及 $\\operatorname{OmegaProof}_{\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}}$ 取 [[72-df-omega-proof]]：实际证明对象为 $\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega},\\eta\\rangle$，已经包含局部合法性与良基性。$\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\ell(())$ 为其根相继式。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_A}$、$\\models$ 与 $\\operatorname{FV}_{72}$ 的core语义接口取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]。标准结构 $\\mathfrak N_A$ 的四个分量在Assertion中给出；$0,S,+,\\cdot,<$ 在解释函数左侧为签名符号，在右侧为标准自然数运算或关系。$m,n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_A","display":false},{"tex":"J_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\Sigma_A}","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\doteq","display":false},{"tex":"=","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma_A}(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OmegaProof}_{\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega},\\eta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\ell(())","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_A","display":false},{"tex":"0,S,+,\\cdot,<","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nI_C&:=\\{\\langle0,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_F&:=\\{\\langle S,\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle,n+1\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle,\\langle+,\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,m+n\\rangle:m,n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle,\\langle\\cdot,\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,m\\cdot n\\rangle:m,n\\in\\omega\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\nI_R&:=\\{\\langle<,\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\omega^2:m<n\\}\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak N_A&:=\\langle\\omega,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\Sigma_A}&:=\\{A\\in X_{\\Sigma_A}:\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_A}(\\mathfrak N_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma_A}(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA})\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\Sigma_A}\\quad\\bigl[\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\langle(),\\langle\\sigma\\rangle\\rangle\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak N_A\\models\\sigma\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma_A}(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA})\\quad\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\langle(),\\langle J_f(0=S0)\\rangle\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"J_f(0=S0)","display":false},{"tex":"0\\doteq S0","display":false}],"bytes":3653,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-240","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-omega-rule-soundness|thm-omega-rule-soundness — PA加ω规则的标准模型可靠性]]"}],"outgoing":["5c014dab66d624c8","2d84a32e163edd84","f57c523092bba1d6","9ba5875c85771b52","c60a11e47ac58326","5e5fb64772853785"]}